From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:24:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 088/110] Rich text that the mouse can select, also across
 paragraphs

A port of iced's rich text (spans, colours, fonts, links) that draws a
selection in the theme's selection colour. The selection lives with its
owner, shared by all text runs numbered in document order, so a drag
from one run into another selects everything in between. Only the run
under the pointer hit-tests. The selected text is copied as plain text:
blocks apart by a blank line, list items and code lines on their own
lines, table cells tab-separated per row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

